<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head>
<meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Our Guides — Meet the Naturalists | Jungle Travels India</title>
<meta name="description" content="Meet the naturalists and culture guides of Jungle Travels India — in their own words. Their favourite places, their best stories, and why they do what they do.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant:wght@400;500;600&family=EB+Garamond:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;1,400&family=Jost:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>{% include "_css_guides.njk" %}</style></head><body>
{% include "_nav_guides.njk" %}
<section class="ghero"><div class="wrap"><div class="center-mark"></div><p class="eyebrow">The people behind every journey</p>
<h1>Our Guides</h1>
<p class="lede">We use our own guides and naturalists — people we know and can personally vouch for — rather than subcontracting. Meet some of them here.</p></div></section>
<div class="crumbs"><div class="wrap"><a href="/">Home</a> &nbsp;/&nbsp; Guides</div></div>
<section class="gsection"><div class="wrap"><div class="ggrid">
{% for g in collections.guides %}
<a class="gcard" href="/guides/{{ g.data.slug }}/">
  <div class="gph"><img src="{{ g.data.photo if g.data.photo else g.data.photo_fallback }}" alt="{{ g.data.name }}"></div>
  <div class="gb"><p class="gk">{{ g.data.kicker }}</p><h3>{{ g.data.name }}</h3><p class="grole">{{ g.data.role }}{% if g.data.region %} · {{ g.data.region }}{% endif %}</p>
  {% if g.data.intro %}<p class="gquote">&ldquo;{{ g.data.intro }}&rdquo;</p>{% endif %}
  <span class="gview">{% if g.data.interview and g.data.interview.length %}Read the interview{% else %}Meet {{ g.data.name }}{% endif %} &rarr;</span></div>
</a>
{% endfor %}
</div></div></section>
<section class="ginvite"><div class="wrap"><div class="center-mark" style="margin:0 auto 20px;"></div>
<p class="eyebrow">Travel with one of them</p><h2>Let a naturalist show you their India</h2>
<p>Every journey we build is led by one of the people above — tell us what you're drawn to, and we'll match you with the right guide.</p>
<a class="btn btn-red" href="/#enquire">Start planning</a></div></section>
{% include "_footer_guides.njk" %}
</body></html>
